    "updated_at": "2025-01-27T06:56:35Z",
    "body": "Getting back to this a bit later: can you explain what the purpose of the destroyed flag is, over just moving the \"Set _container_'s content navigable to null\" to the afterAllDestruction steps?\n\nLooking at https://github.com/search?q=repo%3ASerenityOS%2Fserenity%20has_been_destroyed&type=code , I worry that this introduces an intermediate state which some parts of the spec will check instead of checking fully active.",
